  "title": "Ph Insurance Faqs Objections — Section 3: Human Escalation & Support Triggers",
  "content": "## Section 3: Human Escalation & Support Triggers\n- When the caller asks to speak to an agent, financial advisor, or manager (*\"Gusto ko pong makausap ang financial advisor\"*, *\"pwede po ba ahente\"*, *\"speak to human representative\"*):\n  - Agent warmly confirms: *\"Sige po, ikokonekta ko po kayo agad sa isa sa aming licensed Financial Advisors sa Darwix Life Bancassurance. Sandali lamang po habang inililipat ko ang inyong tawag.\"*",
